  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> satisfies the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt></msqrt></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>256</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math>"
  },
